// Sum of the distinct winning labeled hammings on the kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. One hamming returns that hamming.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hksum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hksum rank

IMPULSE hksum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hksum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
